    "intro_narrative": "The neon lights of Outpost 74 flicker as a blaring siren cuts through the underground black-site laboratory. You are a covert operative tasked with infiltrating this rogue facility to retrieve highly sensitive intel, but your presence has triggered a complete facility lockdown. The heavy titanium blast doors are sealed tight, and a silent self-destruct protocol has been initiated in the shadows. Your only way out is to retrieve the core initialization vector from the facility's master server. To survive, you must navigate a web of disconnected computer systems, bypass heavy firewalls, and override experimental biometric locks before the timer reaches zero. The air is thick with the smell of ozone and burnt wiring. Every terminal, fabricator, and locked vault in this room is part of a complex security network left behind by the rogue scientists. You need to carefully analyze the scattered devices, deduce how their data flows connect to one another, and extract the vital codes you need to orchestrate your escape. Time is running out, and the automated defenses are slowly coming online.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
